{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309290","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1130929001:1":{"text":"…아스나의 부모가 갱도를 팔 때 불의의 사고로 그만…","source_cn":"……是阿苏纳的父母。他们在高原上开凿隧道的时候，被落石...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44A9BA42725B373E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130929002:1":{"text":"우린 블랙골드 놈들에게 속아 같이 일하러 갔는데, 저희만 돌아오고 이 아이의 부모는…","source_cn":"我们这些人是一起被黑金骗去做工的，但她的父母……再也回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78AB751416850B25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130929003:1":{"text":"다른 가족들이 재회하는 모습을 보며 얼마나 힘들었을꼬...","source_cn":"不知道她看到其他人一家团圆的场景，该有多难受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBD292B1C932DB69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130929004:1":{"text":"그러게. 게다가 아스나는 워낙 말수도 적은 아이인데…","source_cn":"是啊，而且阿苏纳本来就不爱说话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BE36CDB5270EC70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1130929005:1":{"text":"우선은 방해하지 않는 게 좋겠어. 조금 지나면 괜찮아지겠지.","source_cn":"还是先别打扰她了，也许过段日子，她会好受一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26E989C2A3A96ABD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","